Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.39,0:00:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather round, come take a look...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.35,0:00:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Theatre of Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.57,0:00:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumpkin Field
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.22,0:00:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is spending the summer vacation at grandmother's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.24,0:00:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,A story of an elementary school student.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.38,0:00:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I the only one who has to go to Grandma's place?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.66,0:00:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mom is having a hard time because her belly is so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.86,0:00:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.70,0:00:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, fell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.34,0:00:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then bury it in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.34,0:00:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Field?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.78,0:00:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the rule around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.26,0:00:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up before you lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:00:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.81,0:01:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.77,0:01:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.35,0:01:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too boring and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.35,0:01:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,i can't go back to Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.75,0:01:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Because my little brother is about to be born.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.71,0:01:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, i see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.35,0:01:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're free, let's play together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.21,0:01:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it evening already? I have to head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.49,0:01:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.85,0:01:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.52,0:01:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.20,0:01:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.90,0:01:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.70,0:01:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s nothing going on, but
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.18,0:01:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Every day like this is not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.14,0:01:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Time flies while you're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.70,0:02:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be even more fun if I had siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.63,0:02:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're heading back to your home in Tokyo soon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,i don't want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.03,0:02:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish summer vacation would never end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.35,0:02:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I grant it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.19,0:02:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.15,0:02:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Exchange for something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.99,0:02:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's nothing I can give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.15,0:02:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You have.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.27,0:02:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Something very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.07,0:02:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,come on, let's exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.40,0:02:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it this field wide like that before?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.52,0:02:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.68,0:02:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuta!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.38,0:02:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.18,0:02:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.74,0:02:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.22,0:02:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.22,0:02:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,let's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.74,0:02:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.55,0:03:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.15,0:03:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.67,0:03:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing it didn't amount to anything worse than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.19,0:03:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.71,0:03:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.74,0:03:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,THE END
